          "kicker": "Eligibility talk",
          "heading": "Steve Hansen says Mark Nawaqanitawase could be better off playing for Fiji",
          "body": "Former All Blacks coach Sir Steve Hansen has said that Mark Nawaqanitawase, who is weighing up his Test options after returning to union with Japanese club Saitama Wild Knights, could be better off playing for Fiji. Hansen said he hopes the 26-year-old plays for Australia, but that if Japan commitments take priority, Nawaqanitawase probably won't be available much for the Wallabies anyway. He has 11 Australia caps and would also be eligible for Italy and Fiji."
