          "body": "Hospitality provider Keith Prowse has unveiled packages for England's three home Six Nations games in 2027, against France, Italy and Scotland at Twickenham. Options range from the Rose Garden, with its rooftop terrace, live music and all-inclusive bar, to The Lock, a four-course menu developed in collaboration with chef Tom Kerridge. Ticket options for all three games have been confirmed, and the Allianz Suite offers grazing stations while guests hear from an international rugby legend."
