          "heading": "Quesada reveals 17 unavailable Italy players as captaincy call nears",
          "body": "Italy head into the November window with 17 players unavailable, Gonzalo Quesada said at the launch of the Northern Phase, and he will decide on the captaincy next week. He is monitoring 67 players of national interest, and Giacomo Nicotera and Niccolò Cannone have both captained before. The run is four consecutive matches against top-ten opponents: South Africa in Turin, Argentina in Genoa and Fiji in Udine, before the final phase in London. The captaincy call will depend on who is actually available."
