          "heading": "Wales wing Ellis Mee signs new Scarlets contract, length of deal undisclosed",
          "body": "Wales wing Ellis Mee has signed a new contract with Scarlets, though the length of the deal has not been disclosed. The 23-year-old has made 43 appearances for the Parc y Scarlets club since joining from Nottingham in 2024, scoring 11 tries, and has 11 Test appearances for Wales since his debut against Ireland in the 2025 Six Nations. Mee's form has also earned him a place in Steve Tandy's squad for the upcoming Nations Championship games. \"I am delighted to have re-signed with the Scarlets,\" he said."
