          "heading": "Tom Hooper cleared of major injury after shoulder blow, Les Kiss confirms",
          "body": "Back-rower Tom Hooper has been cleared of any major injury concerns, with Les Kiss confirming that all scans came back clear after he was taken off early for Exeter last week with a shoulder injury. A repeat of the scapula fracture he suffered in the July Tests had been feared, but Kiss said, ‘it’s just sore but all scans have cleared everything.’ Carter Gordon and Ben Donaldson, who both missed the Bledisloe Cup Test in Sydney, are also likely to be available."
