          "body": "Saula Ma'u was picked for the 36-man squad after Tyrel Lomax was ruled out with a neck issue. Sir John Kirwan, on the Rivals podcast, wants more size up front against South Africa, pointing to Ma'u and Pasilio Tosi, both around 22st. \"I'm hoping they're going to get some opportunities to play and start Test matches up north because I do think we need their size.\" Ma'u has yet to earn a cap but is expected to make his Test debut next month."
